### Normal conversation
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{"userId":"customer-101","sessionId":"gst-od-1001","message":"Hi, I want to apply for GST OD"}

### Business information (same session)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{"userId":"customer-101","sessionId":"gst-od-1001","message":"My business is ABC Traders and GSTIN is 07ABCDE1234F1Z5"}

### Document registration (file must already be uploaded)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{"userId":"customer-101","sessionId":"gst-od-1001","message":"Please register bank statement document doc-123 against application app-456"}
